# Facts about Mira Ten (they/them).

@fact mira.artificer
tier: surface
text: An artificer who smells of solder and ozone and has started at least one small fire.

@fact mira.owl
tier: personal
unlock: seen(mira_owl_gift) > 0
text: Built a clockwork owl that remembers deadlines, birthdays and, slightly, grudges.

@fact mira.notebooks
tier: personal
unlock: rel(mira) >= 20
text: Three years of notebooks are the most precious things they own.

@fact mira.family
tier: personal
unlock: seen(mira_family_business) > 0
text: Their family runs a clockworks and thinks invention is a hobby. It is not a hobby.

@fact mira.name_day
tier: secret
unlock: seen(mira_name_day) > 0
text: Nobody ever remembered their name day before.

@fact mira.workshop
tier: personal
unlock: seen(mira_workshop_closed) > 0
text: After the third fire in a term, the faculty padlocked their workshop.
